        "name": "alex6",
        "username": "alex6",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/58956e/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-06-04T05:21:28.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>-So, the only deck that we are told shuffle is the station deck. Does card order in the mission or ship decks matter? Or should all decks be shuffled?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>-Gaining credits...does this discard the cards? Do we have to show other platers hand to prove credit values? Are hands open information?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>-playing against the Syndicate. It says to deploy cards from ship deck. &nbsp;To where? This sector? Any sector?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>the rules are good in general, but make many assumptions about familiarity with the game</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:41:30.028Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
