        "raw": "<p>-So, the only deck that we are told shuffle is the station deck. Does card order in the mission or ship decks matter? Or should all decks be shuffled?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>-Gaining credits...does this discard the cards? Do we have to show other platers hand to prove credit values? Are hands open information?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>-playing against the Syndicate. It says to deploy cards from ship deck. &nbsp;To where? This sector? Any sector?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>the rules are good in general, but make many assumptions about familiarity with the game</p>",
