      {
        "id": 105531,
        "name": "pwatson1974",
        "username": "pwatson1974",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pwatson1974/{size}/1925_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-06-04T07:55:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I shuffle everything at the start but only shuffle the station cards in game.</p><p>No, it does not discard the cards. Showing is up to you as it's a co-op but I always do out of habit. Once you've got your money, you can then play the cards for effects if you wish. When teaching I keep hands open so that it's easier for people so see what I'm doing. when not, I prefer closed hands, to prevent me going Alpha player and running everyone else's game for them.</p><p>Consensus is it should be \"this sector\" but it is not officially confirmed.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:35:10.047Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
