        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>I shuffle everything at the start but only shuffle the station cards in game.</p><p>No, it does not discard the cards. Showing is up to you as it&#39;s a co-op but I always do out of habit. Once you&#39;ve got your money, you can then play the cards for effects if you wish. When teaching I keep hands open so that it&#39;s easier for people so see what I&#39;m doing. when not, I prefer closed hands, to prevent me going Alpha player and running everyone else&#39;s game for them.</p><p>Consensus is it should be &quot;this sector&quot; but it is not officially confirmed.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
